<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title data-translate="aboutTitle">About Vaultique</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href= "/CSS/aboutus.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/nav-bar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/footer.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/Loading Screen.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/Contact-Us.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/Assets/Images/LogoV.jpg">
    <script src="/Javascript/nav-bar.js"></script>
    <script src="/Javascript/Loading Screen.js"></script>
    <script src="/Javascript/Light-Mode.js"></script>
</head>

<body>

     <%- include('partials/loading-screen') %>
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>

    <!-- HERO SECTION WITH BACKGROUND VIDEO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline class="bg-video">
            <source src="BackgroundVideoAbout.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>

        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1 data-translate="aboutTitle">About Vaultique</h1>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT SECTION -->
    <section class="content-section">
        <div class="left">
            <h2 data-translate="aboutReputation">An unrivalled reputation for quality and expertise</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
            <p><strong># <span class="italic" data-translate="aboutSlogan">Vaultique – Find the Perfect Watch, Effortlessly</span></strong></p>

            <p data-translate="aboutIntro">At <span class="italic">Vaultique</span>, we understand that a watch is more than just a timepiece—it is
                a reflection of your style, personality, and ambitions. Whether you seek a statement piece, a reliable
                everyday watch, or a timepiece built for adventure, we make the search effortless and tailored to you.
            </p>

            <h3><span class="italic" data-translate="aboutPersonalized">Personalized Recommendations, Designed for You</span></h3>
            <p data-translate="aboutPersonalizedDesc">With countless options available, finding the right watch can be overwhelming. That is why we have
                developed an <span class="italic">intelligent recommendation system</span> that refines your shopping
                experience to match your preferences.</p>
            <ul>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep1"><span class="italic">Tell us what you like</span> – Answer a few simple questions about your style,
                    preferred materials, lifestyle, and budget.</li>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep2"><span class="italic">Receive curated suggestions</span> – Our advanced system analyzes your
                    preferences to present watches that align with your taste.</li>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep3"><span class="italic">Refine over time</span> – The more you browse, the more precise our
                    recommendations become, ensuring an even more tailored experience with every visit.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3><span class="italic" data-translate="aboutSeamless">A Seamless Shopping Experience</span></h3>
            <p data-translate="aboutSeamlessDesc">Vaultique is designed to make watch shopping effortless, enjoyable, and refined.</p>
            <ul>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep4"><span class="italic">Advanced filtering and smart search</span> – Quickly find the right watch by
                    brand, price, materials, and specifications.</li>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep5"><span class="italic">Detailed product pages</span> – Explore high-resolution imagery, in-depth
                    specifications, brand history, and customer reviews.</li>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep6"><span class="italic">Secure checkout and flexible payment options</span> – A seamless and protected
                    transaction process.</li>
                <li data-translate="aboutStep7"><span class="italic">Order tracking and notifications</span> – Stay informed at every stage of your
                    purchase.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3><span class="italic" data-translate="aboutDiscover">Discover Watches Made for You</span></h3>
            <p data-translate="aboutDiscoverDesc">From timeless classics to contemporary designs, Vaultique ensures you find a watch that suits your style
                and needs—without the guesswork. <span class="italic">Begin your journey today.</span></p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
<!-- ملفات الترجمة -->
<script src="/Javascript/translations.js"></script>
<script src="/Javascript/language.js"></script>
</body>

</html>